	<TextRow
		Label="msg_un_default_woman_00"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>？？？『あ　[Name:TrainerName Idx="3"]？▼
[Name:TrainerName Idx="3"]よね？▼
ひさしぶり！▼
[Name:Location Idx="0"]の
[Name:Area Idx="1"]から▽
きた　[Name:TrainerName Idx="7"]よ　おぼえてる？▼
この　あいだは　[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="5"]を
どうも　ありがとう！▽
とっても　げんきに　してるわよ▼
わたしが　あげた
[Name:PokemonNickname Idx="9"]は　げんき？▼
って　きっと　[Name:TrainerName Idx="3"]と
いっしょなら　しんぱいむようね！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:12" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>？？？『あ　[Name:TrainerName Idx="3"]？▼
[Name:TrainerName Idx="3"]よね？▼
久しぶり！▼
[Name:Location Idx="0"]の
[Name:Area Idx="1"]から▽
